 and Haaland vs Fernandes? Hopefully you will find this video useful!\n\nIf you like what you see, subscribe and become my latest mate!\n\n📧 Business enquiries: dan@fplmate.co.uk\n\n🐦 https://www.twitter.com/FPLMate\n📸 https://www.instagram.com/FPLMate\n🎶 https://www.tiktok.com/@FPLMate\n🎮 https://www.twitch.tv/fpl_mate\n👾 https://discord.gg/rfVSeftbmx\n🏆 Join: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCweDAlFm2LnVcOqaFU4_AGA/join\n️⚽️ FPL Mate league link: https://fantasy.premierleague.com/leagues/auto-join/behupk\n️⚽️ FPL Mate league code: behupk\n\n#fpl #fantasypremierleague #premierleague","isCrawlable":true,"thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/0aBkDGCwhH0/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEmCKgBEF5IWvKriqkDGQgBFQAAAAAYASUAAMhCPQCAokN4AbgC9xg=\u0026rs=AOn4CLBiH6wUsjL7IK4r6Dy0_KCBjLZEbw","width":168,"height":94},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/0aBkDGCwhH0/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEmCMQBEG5IWvKriqkDGQgBFQAAAAAYASUAAMhCPQCAokN4AbgC9xg=\u0026rs=AOn4CLCw-GfjBMapYAXGU4Zy0SoGwoEXhw","width":196,"height":110},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/0aBkDGCwhH0/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEnCPYBEIoBSFryq4qpAxkIARUAAAAAGAElAADIQj0AgKJDeAG4AvcY\u0026rs=AOn4CLDsbCFycfRoXPvkHiJrKP8kHa5aSA","width":246,"height":138},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/0aBkDGCwhH0/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEnCNACELwBSFryq4qpAxkIARUAAAAAGAElAADIQj0AgKJDeAG4AvcY\u0026rs=AOn4CLCa9wsXaK0JWN2O1G3PmdSI_pOudg","width":336,"height":188},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/0aBkDGCwhH0/maxresdefault.jpg","width":1920,"height":1080}]},"allowRatings":true,"viewCount":"73319","author":"FPL Mate","isPrivate":false,"isUnpluggedCorpus":false,"isLiveContent":false,"isTvfilmVideo":false},"annotations":[{"playerAnnotationsExpandedRenderer":{"featuredChannel":{"startTimeMs":"15000","endTimeMs":"1469000","watermark":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/an/weDAlFm2LnVcOqaFU4_AGA/featured_channel.jpg?v=64f1aeae","width":40,"height":40}]},"trackingParams":"CBMQ8zciEwiQ4rOe9quWAxUofEwIHW95Hk4=","navigationEndpoint":{"clickTrackingParams