sy Premier League 2025-26 is finally here! Welcome to my FPL latest draft team selection video for GW1 for the 2026/27 Premier League season!\n\nThe Fantasy Premier League game has been launched for the new 26/27 season, which means we can finally select our teams. In this video I go over my initial thoughts on the best picks, including best captains and cheap budget options... and Haaland vs Fernandes? Hopefully you will find this video useful!\n\nIf you like what you see, subscribe and become my latest mate!\n\n📧 Business enquiries: dan@fplmate.co.uk\n\n🐦   / fplmate  \n📸   / fplmate  \n🎶   / fplmate  \n🎮   / fpl_mate  \n👾   / discord  \n🏆 Join:    / @fplmate  \n️⚽️ FPL Mate league link: https://fantasy.premierleague.com/lea...\n️⚽️ FPL Mate league code: behupk\n\n#fpl #fantasypremierleague #premierleague","commandRuns":[{"startIndex":32,"length":40,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CBUQ040EGAYiEwie8bOe9quWAxWuYvIAHQauIVFI_YjChcaBmdDRAcoBBAhnvOI=","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rUXFsVFh5VGk2NjR1SWZ0REk2eW9nWXxBR3JiS2FuandQV1ZQQ2YwMTB6bU5Rb1c4Y0dfM2hzWEF3bXhYNk9LbGQ2YWdTMDlWOGUxMlNDRG5wUk0tMmFtZV9IT0V5RVg0VEpmZ0lyMS1NV2VsVjFPcGt0NG5rZXFwVzV5\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fgo.fantasyfootballhub.co.uk%2Fai-team-rating%3Futm_source%3Daffiliate%26utm_medium%3Daffiliates%26utm_campaign%3DFPLMate%26utm_content%3Dteam-rating%26via%3DFPLMate\u0026v=0aBkDGCwhH0","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_UNKNOWN","rootVe":83769}},"urlEndpoint":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rUXFsVFh5VGk2NjR1SWZ0REk2eW9nWXxBR3JiS2FuandQV1ZQQ2YwMTB6bU5Rb1c4Y0dfM2hzWEF3bXhYNk9LbGQ2YWdTMDlWOGUxMlNDRG5wUk0tMmFtZV9IT0V5RVg0VEpmZ0lyMS1NV2VsVjFPcGt0NG5rZXFwVzV5\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fgo.fantasyfootballhub.co.uk%2Fai-team-rating%3Futm_source%3Daffiliate%26utm_medium%3Daffiliates%26utm_campaign%3DFPLMate%26utm_content%3Dteam-rating%26via%3DFPLMate\u0026v=